# API Health Check & Automated Deployment Tool
2
 
3
A DevOps project that automatically deploys a Flask-based API through GitLab CI/CD and performs health checks after deployment.
4
 
5
## Features
6
 
7
- Flask API
8
- Docker containerization
9
- Automated deployment with GitLab CI/CD
10
- SSH-based remote deployment
11
- Health check endpoint
12
- Automated Docker image rebuild on every push
13
 
14
## Architecture
15
 
16
Git Push
17
↓
18
GitLab CI/CD
19
↓
20
SSH Deployment
21
↓
22
Docker Build
23
↓
24
Container Restart
25
↓
26
Health Check
27
 
28
